  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Reflective possessive",
   "texto": [
    "**Sin**, **sitt** and **sine** refer to something that belongs to the subject of prayer: **Han rydder boden sin** («He orders his own storage.»). The form depends on the noun: common, **sin**; neutral, **sitt**; plural, **sine**."
   ]
